            "heading": "How can I determine my correct clothing size when shopping online?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We understand that finding the perfect fit can be challenging when shopping online. To ensure the right fit, we recommend consulting our size guide, which provides detailed measurements for each garment. Additionally, you can take your own measurements and compare them to our size chart for the most accurate sizing information.</p>",
