            "heading": "How do I stay updated on new arrivals and promotions?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>To stay informed about our latest arrivals, promotions, and exclusive offers, we recommend subscribing to our newsletter. You can easily sign up by entering your email address in the subscription box at the bottom of our website's homepage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16391993851961__97242259-b81f-4b22-b380-d0f66a6a277b-collapsible_row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are your products made from sustainable materials?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we are committed to sustainability and ethical sourcing practices. Many of our products are made from eco-friendly materials such as organic cotton, recycled polyester, and sustainable fibers like Tencel and bamboo.Look for our \"sustainable\" or \"eco-friendly\" tags on product pages to identify these items.</p>",
            "page": ""
